      "descriptions": {
        "shortDescriptionText": "These 3 uniquely thrilling elevated rope courses traverse the terrain of Roaring Mountain, stepping through spectacular caverns.",
        "shortDescriptionMobileText": "These 3 uniquely thrilling elevated rope courses traverse the terrain of Roaring Mountain, taking adventurers over river gorges, waterfalls and sheer cliffs, through stunning terrain and into spectacular caverns. Help the League of Adventurers solve the island’s most ancient mysteries.\n<br/>\n<br/>\nPlease note: This is an overhead activity and appropriate attire must be worn at all times. Closed-toe shoes with secured heel strap are required. "
      },
      "entityCards": [
        {
          "cardType": "StoryCard",
          "cardData": [
            {
              "header": "Traverse the thrilling archeological wonders",
              "text": "<p>These 3 uniquely thrilling elevated rope courses traverse the terrain of Roaring Mountain—taking adventurers over river gorges, waterfalls and sheer cliffs, through stunning terrain and into spectacular caverns.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Hidden Falls Chamber</strong> – Journey behind a waterfall and deep into the jungle to a mystical cavern, home to the glittering gem-encrusted Temple of the Milky Way.</li>\n<li><strong>Echo Cavern</strong> – Wind along a perilous river gorge, discover magnificent rock carvings and cave paintings, and hear for yourself how Echo Canyon got its name.</li>\n<li><strong>House of the Ancients</strong> – Trek to the site of an in-progress excavation, where League of Adventurers archeologists are unearthing an ancient Arbori trading center.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Please note: Guests must be at least 106 centimeters (41.5 inches) or taller to experience the 3 rope courses of the Challenge Trails at Camp Discovery.</strong></p>",
              "media": [
                {
                  "type": "image/jpeg",
                  "title": "",
                  "url": "https://static.shanghaidisneyresort.com/tridion/prod/en/system/images/shdr-att-challenge-trails-01_tcm1871-116274.jpg",
                  "width": 170,
                  "height": 96
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "cardType": "buttonCard",
          "cardData": [
            {
              "header": "Excitement for Explorers of All Ages",
              "text": "Choose your course, set out for adventure and prepare for the incredible! For everyone, from the most fearless trailblazer to the youngest League of Adventurers recruit, Camp Discovery offers rare experiences and remarkable sights few have ever encountered.",
              "media": [
                {
                  "type": "image/jpeg",
                  "title": "",
                  "url": "https://static.shanghaidisneyresort.com/tridion/prod/en/system/images/shdr-att-camp-discovery-02-new_tcm1871-114799.jpg",
                  "width": 170,
                  "height": 96
                }
              ],
              "buttonCardUrl": "https://www.shanghaidisneyresort.com/en/experience/attraction/camp-discovery"
            }
          ]
